[statement]
Where several packages requested provide a name a dependency states, the
walk follows the first of them in the order of names: `bp` before `a`,
`zp` after it.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
D:v

P:zp
V:1
p:v

P:bp
V:1
p:v

[request]
a
bp
zp

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install bp 1
install a 1
install zp 1
